# Complete Resend Email API Admin Platform
## Build a Full-Featured Email Management System Using Resend API

---

## 🎯 Mission Statement

Build a **complete email marketing & transactional platform** that replicates and extends Resend's dashboard functionality, entirely within your own admin interface. 

**Goal:** One API key. Complete control. Never touch `resend.com/dashboard` again.

**What you'll build:**
- Transactional email sending (password resets, confirmations, notifications)
- Marketing campaigns & broadcasts to audience segments
- Contact/subscriber management with custom properties
- Email template builder & management
- Real-time analytics dashboard (opens, clicks, bounces, complaints)
- Webhook event handling & audit logs
- Domain management & verification
- Full audit trail & compliance features

