## 🔑 Authentication & Setup

### Environment Variables Required

```bash
# Resend API Key (from https://resend.com/api-keys)
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Your admin panel secret (for protecting admin endpoints)
ADMIN_SECRET_KEY=your-super-secret-admin-key

# Webhook signing secret (for verifying Resend webhooks)
RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxxxxxx

# Sender domain (must be verified in Resend)
SENDER_DOMAIN=noreply@yourdomain.com
SENDER_NAME="Your Company"
```

### Authentication Strategy

All Resend API calls use Bearer token authentication:

```bash
Authorization: Bearer re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: your-app/1.0
```

**Admin endpoints** in your platform use your own token (`ADMIN_SECRET_KEY`).

