## 📨 Broadcasts (Marketing Campaigns)

### What are Broadcasts?

<cite index="12-1">Broadcasts allow you to send emails to Audiences with dynamic content personalization and automatic unsubscribe handling</cite>.

### 1. Create Broadcast: POST `/broadcasts`

```json
{
  "audience_id": "aud_abc123xyz",
  "name": "Q1 Product Launch",
  "subject": "🚀 Lucida Q1 Updates — Universal Lead Scoring",
  "html": "<h1>Welcome</h1><p>Hi {{first_name}},</p><p>We've launched...</p>",
  "from": "noreply@lucida.com",
  "reply_to": "support@lucida.com",
  "scheduled_at": "2025-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "tags": ["marketing", "q1-launch"],
  "track_opens": true,
  "track_clicks": true,
  "preview_text": "Check out our latest features"
}
```

**Dynamic Content:**

- `{{first_name}}` — replaced with contact's first_name
- `{{last_name}}` — replaced with contact's last_name
- `{{custom_property}}` — replaced with custom contact property
- `{{{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}}` — automatic unsubscribe link (required)

**Response:**

```json
{
  "id": "broadcast_abc123def",
  "audience_id": "aud_abc123xyz",
  "name": "Q1 Product Launch",
  "subject": "🚀 Lucida Q1 Updates",
  "status": "draft",
  "scheduled_at": "2025-02-01T10:00:00Z",
  "created_at": "2025-01-15T10:30:00.000Z"
}
```

