## 🎓 What Your AI Agent Needs to Know

1. **Resend is API-first** — everything the dashboard can do, the API can do
2. **Bearer token authentication** — all requests need `Authorization: Bearer re_xxx`
3. **Webhooks are your real-time data source** — rely on them for opens/clicks/bounces
4. **Contacts are global** — one contact can be in multiple audiences
5. **Broadcasts use dynamic content** — {{first_name}} gets replaced per contact
6. **Rate limits exist** — 10 requests/second per team, implement retry logic
7. **Idempotency keys prevent duplicates** — use UUID for same email sent twice
8. **Custom properties are powerful** — store any JSON on contacts and use in templates
9. **Unsubscribe is automatic** — Resend handles GDPR/CAN-SPAM for you
10. **Never store API key in code** — always use environment variables

